:::question Second marker and annotator
The author decides who marks and annotates the second half of the corpus. It must be someone who did not write the tasks. Until then the protocol cannot report marker effects.
:::

:::agent Study 1 constraints
- Tasks are written from the annotations, never from an agent view.
- Never change a document, a task or the scorer after the confirmatory run starts. Any change restarts the run.
- Send only documents written for the study or under a licence that allows it to model providers.
- Report token counts from provider usage, and keep estimated counts labelled as estimates.
:::
